{"unit_id":"carlclouder__dsh-image-serve#feature-route","repo":"carlclouder/dsh-image-serve","commit":"eceec455421a033d8c8bb956ea1c85204d698a21","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-image-serve 的功能「本地文件展示」：通过 /ws/<绝对路径> 请求本机文件，支持 GET 和 HEAD，并按扩展名返回常见图片、文本和网页文件的 MIME 类型。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.mjs:123-163"]}
{"unit_id":"carlclouder__dsh-image-serve#feature-directory","repo":"carlclouder/dsh-image-serve","commit":"eceec455421a033d8c8bb956ea1c85204d698a21","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-image-serve 的功能「目录浏览」：访问目录路径可得到 HTML 文件列表，也可用 ?json=1 获取条目名称、类型、大小和修改时间；目录链接支持逐级打开。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.mjs:91-117"]}
