{"unit_id":"carlclouder__dsh-image-serve#feature-cache","repo":"carlclouder/dsh-image-serve","commit":"eceec455421a033d8c8bb956ea1c85204d698a21","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-image-serve 的功能「条件缓存与下载」：文件响应附带 ETag 和 Last-Modified，匹配 If-None-Match 时返回 304；加 ?download 可按附件方式下载文件。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.mjs:208-237"]}
